pment (combination microwave oven) &\nintegrated washer/dryer\nf/ sustainable luxury - natural materials applied where possible\ng/ Selected units include a pull-out integrated dining table to seat additional guests\nh/ bathrooms - quality TOTO wares from Japan and Germany, integrated storage and lighted mirrors\ni/ kitchen - SMEG italian appliances, natural quartz countertop & backsplash, integrated granite basin\nfrom Germany\nj/ cabinet for distribution board- built in cabinet\nk/ wall mounted air con system- Daikin\nl/ hot water supply to kitchen and all bathrooms (storage water heaters)\nm/ High ceiling heights of almost 4.5 metres create a luxurious sense of space.\n6. Façade Features\na/ Traditional materials provide inspiration for the rear extension block, such as the modern use of\nterracotta roof tiles.\nb/ Unique breeze blocks inspired by traditional ventilation double as weather protection while gently\nadapting to modern forms and materials.\nc/ Unique jack roof features allow light and air to breathe in the mezzanine bedrooms","facilities":"1st Storey:\n- Electric Car Charging\n- E-bike Charging\n- Mechanical Car Park (10 lots)\n- Car Park (7+1 lots)\n- Bicycle Lots (x no.s)\n- Accessible Washroom\n2nd Storey:\n- 12.5 meter Swimming Pool\n- Jacuzzi\n- Accessible Washroom\n- Outdoor Pool Shower\nCommon Area:\n- Security audio intercom system between each unit and visitor call panel (Smart phone enabled)\n- Security gate system with card access","nearbyAmenities":null},"units":[["Apartments","1",2,"ART NOVEL 1",506,1,1,"1 BEDROOM","sold",null,null],["Apartments","1",3,"ART NOVEL 2B",624,2,2,"2 BEDROOM","sold",null,null],["Apartments","1",4,"ART NOVEL 2B",624,2,2,"2 BEDROOM","sold",null,null],["Apartments","1",5,"ART NOVEL PH3+1",1098,3,2,"3+1 BEDROOM","sold",2402424,null],["Apartments","10",2,"ART DECO 2 +1B",1292,2,2,"2+1 BEDROOM","available",3085296,null],["Apartments","11",2,"ART DECO 2 +1B",1270,2,2,"2+1 BEDROOM","sold",2969260,null],["Apartments","